on october 5th 2017 in downtown hereford  england 27 year old harry godzill was  going about his day as usual he had  taken a day off from his office job to  catch up on some errands and all was  going swimmingly so far he had woken up  early to make a lovely cup of tea and  take his dog for a walk and had noticed  how nice the weather was for the time of  year with hardly any of the usual rain  after a rich fulfilling morning of  finishing up the dishes and laundry at  his flat he was taking a walk to the  corner grocery store to pick up some  milk potatoes and ground beef for the  shepherd's pie he planned to make for  dinner all in all it was a good day to  be harry godsol surely nothing strange  or unusual would come along to derail  this perfectly pleasant and ordinary day  out of nowhere and into what was meant  to be harry godzill's day to himself  suddenly strolled a truly odd sight  walking down the sidewalk towards him  was a person in a full spacesuit like  those worn by nasa and international  space station crew members in the middle  of hereford casual as you please was an  honest-to-god spaceman harry attempted  to walk around this bizarre figure and  carry on with his day but it  deliberately blocked his path and spoke  with a booming voice asking if he would  be willing to join in the fight against  the moon monsters well at this point  harry had just about enough of this  nonsense and his natural penchant for  sarcasm came out oh absolutely you  nutter he said i'm ready to go right now  got my toothbrush and everything let's  fly spaceman he rolled his eyes and once  more attempted to pass the astronaut  rather than taking the hint the figure  was overjoyed at last it declared a  brave warrior hiding in plain sight  admits these pastoral and bucolic humans  let us away fair meet fellow and earn  the glory of heroes we fly  before harry could turn and run away  from what was certainly not an ordinary  man the spaceman grabbed him pulling him  into its unnaturally strong arms and  activated the jetpack strapped to its  back there was a massive sonic boom  shattering every piece of glass in a 300  meter radius as they took off into the  sky at a speed of 25 000 kilometers per  hour they broke through the atmosphere  and ascended into space so quickly that  surrounding observational satellites  could not get a clear image of the two  on their journey harry godzill had been  on an ordinary quest to have a day of  chores and a hearty dinner and now he  had vanished into outer space his body  was never found and he could not be  positively identified on any satellite  images the residents of hereford had  their minds wiped with amnestics by the  scp foundation in order to keep the  story from getting out and harry godsol  was officially declared missing three  months later when no trace of him had  surfaced he was presumed dead to this  day he has never been found it is  uncertain what he saw on his trip into  the stars or what became of him all that  we know is on that fateful day harry  encountered the entity known as  scp-1233 also known as the lunatic or  the moon champion  scp-1233 is a humanoid entity of unknown  species wearing a spacesuit resembling  the emu or extra-vehicular mobility unit  model complete with an opaque visor and  attached jetpack the suit does not  behave like an ordinary spacesuit  capable of withstanding small arms fire  anti-tank munitions landmine blasts and  exposure to incredibly high temperatures  including complete submersion and magma  without any visible damage no radio  microwave or x-ray scanning has been  able to break through the material of  the suit the jetpack is outfitted with a  high-powered rocket propulsion system  capable of accelerating up to 40 500  kilometers per hour at a rate of  acceleration and deceleration that  should instantly kill any human wearing  it in addition to its resilience  scp-1233 displays an anomalous level of  physical strength able to lift and throw  items up to a weight of 65 000 kilograms  without exhaustion the moon champion is  capable of cognizant speech and is  fluent in a large number of languages  able to switch its language depending on  the dominant tongue of whatever area it  is in it communicates via a loudspeaker  installed in its suit and speaks using  flowery language in a loud authoritative  voice that is usually interpreted as  male though the gender of the entity if  it even has a concept of gender at all  is unknown it has a strong grasp of  language but like its behavior its  speech patterns are odd erratic and  sometimes completely impossible to  understand  scp-1233 appears every four to five  years each time following a similar  pattern first the entity will fall from  an unknown height above the surface of  the earth falling at a terminal velocity  similar to that of a small meteorite or  a vehicle re-entering the atmosphere as  it falls scp-1233 will emit red-orange  thermal radiance causing it to be  mistaken for a shooting star if its  descent occurs at night then it will  crash land on the ground leaving a large  crater and causing a small earthquake in  the vicinity it tends to land within 7  to 30 kilometers from a town usually a  smaller municipality with a population  of 30 000 or less then 1233 will climb  out of its crater and head towards the  town on foot or by flight it does not  ordinarily head directly to the town and  has been observed taking its time taking  the scenic route if you will and  engaging in a variety of random detours  scp-1233 has taken the time to inspect  various objects including farm equipment  buildings and plants occasionally it  will pick these plants and has been  observed plucking the petals from a  flower in what can only be identified as  an interplanetary variation on the  classic he loves me he loves me not game  sometimes it will chase after insects  such as grasshoppers and butterflies  demanding that they stop and allow the  entity to observe them once it  accidentally crushed a ladybug between  its hands and wept inconsolably for a  duration of 25 straight minutes in  addition to interacting with insects it  also attempts to speak to various  animals it has been spotted attempting  to interrogate a cow about its motives  greeting a bird as if it were the owner  of a house it was perched on the roof of  and asking a frog where the nearest  place to get something good to eat was  it is unknown what or even if the entity  eats it has been seen pulling root  vegetables from the ground or picking  fruit from bushes and trees and shoving  them directly into its closed visor  crushing them uselessly in what seems to  be an attempt to eat them naturally this  attempt is fruitless do you get it i  joke fruitless because he  anyway when it is not attempting to eat  or interact with new life forms  scp-1233 occasionally will march  directly into large bodies of water such  as lakes or ponds then emerge from them  and shake the water off of its suit it  will also stand completely still for  durations of up to several hours the  reason for any of this behavior like  basically everything else about the  entity is unknown once scp-1233 has  reached the limits of the town it will  attempt to engage with the population  due to its curious nature heightened  strength and lack of any understanding  of proper human behavior this often  results in confusion disruption and a  great deal of property damage a typical  example of scp-1233's interactions with  the general public is found in archive  security camera footage from a bakery in  saratoga springs new york by the name of  sam sweets on august 9 2009  scp-1233 entered the cafe an attempt to  speak with its co-owner 32-year-old bob  parsons parsons greeted the entity with  a friendly if perplexed attitude  presuming it to be a cosplayer taking a  snack break from a nearby comic book  convention the entity identified itself  as moon champion champion of the moon's  defender of space justice and destroyer  of evil after introducing itself as cp  1233 asked bob if he was the president  of earth he was understandably amused by  the question laughing hard enough to  bring tears to his eyes and offered the  entity a free cookie in exchange for  cheering him up scp-1234 identified the  cookie incorrectly obviously as a  parakeet and smashed the confection  uselessly into its unopened visor  scattering crumbs all over the counter  and floor it then attempted to engage  bob in conversation about the moon  monsters that it was dedicated to  fighting in its homeland the majestic  and magnificent moon kingdom  scp-1233 then asked if it could perhaps  befriend a dog and take it back to the  moon and attempted to recruit bob to  fight alongside it against the moon  monsters bob with a great deal of polite  confusion insisted that he had to stay  on earth and continue to run the bakery  in order to keep the citizens fed 1233  thanked him for his time bit him  farewell and crashed through a concrete  while leaving a distinct astronaut  shaped hole  scp-1233 spent the rest of the day  wandering into traffic and causing  several accidents breaking through glass  storefronts challenging a fire hydrant  to hand-to-hand combat making a pile of  stolen bicycles in the middle of a  public park and collecting as many dogs  as it could hold then attempting to use  said dogs as a type of currency to  purchase even more dogs i honestly think  that's genius finally after leaving all  of this head-scratch-inducing  destruction in its wake  scp-1233 activated its jetpack and took  off out of the earth's atmosphere  apparently returning to the moon none of  scp-1233's claims about the moon have  been verified though the foundation  maintains contact with lunar area 32 to  keep an eye out for moon people a moon  kingdom and the moon monsters 1233 spoke  of in the meantime the foundation is  simply doing its best to contain  scp-1233 and minimize its damage as much  as possible because of the anomalous  physical properties of scp-1233 there is  no way to physically contain it at this  point in time until a method of physical  containment can be found secondary  measures will be taken to keep this  lunar lunatic from causing any more  havoc or at the very least reduce its  levels of havoc as much as possible  there's only so much havoc we can  prevent in this world especially when  you have an astronaut plummeting from  the sky on a semi-regular basis the  foundation satellite observation network  argos or atmospheric reconnaissance  global observation system enters  priority two high alert status once  three years and six months have passed  since  scp-1233's last appearance when 1233 is  spotted in the upper thermosphere a  foundation mobile task force will be  deployed in whatever populated area is  close to the entity's estimated landing  point there they will prepare to  administer amnestics and provide a cover  story such as immersive theater piece  prank show 2001 a space odyssey remake  to any civilians who witness  scp-1233's arrival in addition to these  measures there is to be a media blackout  in place in order to prevent knowledge  of 1233 from spreading task force  operatives are authorized to grab the  smartphones of any bystanders attempting  to take photos videos tick tocks or any  other documentation of the entity and  promptly smash them on the ground in  front of them it's not like they're  going to stay mad they're all getting  their memories wiped anyway if scp-1230  stays in the area for an unusually long  amount of time a mass amnestization of  the town or city where it landed may be  authorized though the task force is  permitted to interact with civilians in  order to slow the spread of information  and provide cover stories no interaction  between foundation personnel and  scp-1233 is permitted under any  circumstances even if they think it  would be really funny no matter how epic  your moon man prank might be it's never  worth your life  now go check out nasa lies  scp-2001 space oddity and how to  actually beat scp-3008 the infinite ikea  for more scp videos that'll make you  laugh rather than scream
 

